%%% note
512 KB を超える DW の出力を、要求の後まで持ち出す所 (vm:publish して listener の flow が publisher の返った後に書く、async の中で書く、
cache スコープに入れて次の要求で返す)。mulay は 512 KB を超える出力を spool の流れ (PIPE) にし、要求が終わると消す (ADR 107)。
持ち出す所はバイト列に読み切るか持ち主を引き継ぐので、要求の後でも同じ中身が読める。
%%% port 18579
%%% startdir /tmp/mulay-oracle-big-output
%%% request GET /pub
%%% response 200

published
%%% request GET /check?f=vm.json
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "size": 2688896,
  "head": "[\n  {\n    \"i\": 1,\n   ",
  "tail": "s\": \"abcdefgh\"\n  }\n]",
  "items": 60000
}
%%% request GET /async
%%% response 200

started
%%% request GET /check?f=async.json
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "size": 2688896,
  "head": "[\n  {\n    \"i\": 1,\n   ",
  "tail": "s\": \"abcdefgh\"\n  }\n]",
  "items": 60000
}
%%% request GET /cached?k=a
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "items": 60000,
  "last": {
    "i": 60000,
    "s": "abcdefgh"
  },
  "mime": "application/json"
}
%%% request GET /cached?k=a
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "items": 60000,
  "last": {
    "i": 60000,
    "s": "abcdefgh"
  },
  "mime": "application/json"
}
